{"data": [{"author_id": "1992461", "created_at": "2026-11-03T03:23:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117457541173293157"], "id": "2117457541173293157", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 77, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "日本国内出生人口推移数据公布：2025 年出生人口降至 67 万人，而 2015 年这个数字还是 100 万整。\n\n十年之内直接腰斩掉三分之一的新增人口，这个断崖速度彻底击穿了日本国立人口研究所此前制定的最悲观情景预测线。", "url": "https://x.com/fishjar/status/2117457541173293157"}, {"author_id": "1611656170393194497", "created_at": "2026-11-02T08:23:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117170795877453982"], "id": "2117170795877453982", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117149019386580999", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "出生人口断崖式负增长 https://t.co/4B9YO3R99g", "url": "https://x.com/AlanWan76319411/status/2117170795877453982"}, {"author_id": "1359061717414629380", "created_at": "2026-11-02T02:18:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117078324237496704", "2117078825205121535"], "id": "2117078825205121535", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 159, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "各国出生人口减半花了多少年 https://t.co/A0k1ZSIPg0", "url": "https://x.com/Ninalvz/status/2117078825205121535"}, {"author_id": "1951064331187372032", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:14:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117258929453556212"], "id": "2117258929453556212", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 199, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国新出生人口变化，绘图的人高情商😸 https://t.co/DfCzckIelP", "url": "https://x.com/xianebvjsjj/status/2117258929453556212"}, {"author_id": "2097629682543763456", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:41:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117432019030351894"], "id": "2117432019030351894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 95, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今日地球总出生人口多少？\n死亡人口多少？\n\n各个国家分别列举\n@grok", "url": "https://x.com/haozihan001/status/2117432019030351894"}, {"author_id": "2009622249247281152", "created_at": "2026-11-03T05:57:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117496425751969969"], "id": "2117496425751969969", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 71, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一个冷知识\n\n90后的出生人口是2.08亿\n\n而上一次人口普查显示90后还剩1.84亿", "url": "https://x.com/lanchang_blue/status/2117496425751969969"}, {"author_id": "2061519004125298688", "created_at": "2026-11-03T08:41:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117537642858582478"], "id": "2117537642858582478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我横看竖看，上看下看，没想到中国出生人口率还能这么高🥲🥲🥲 https://t.co/MsCuD95FJ5", "url": "https://x.com/qianwan_X/status/2117537642858582478"}, {"author_id": "785611716155498500", "created_at": "2026-11-02T03:27:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117096165464576241"], "id": "2117096165464576241", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117053242027004376", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "そんなしゃあないやん。\n\n　出生人口多い「団塊」・「団塊ジュニア」親子世代なんやから！！ https://t.co/U0qc8dDIj6", "url": "https://x.com/SAYAS_DIARY/status/2117096165464576241"}, {"author_id": "1725927523291439104", "created_at": "2026-11-02T05:19:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117124529063698700"], "id": "2117124529063698700", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 675, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "目前新出生人口逐年下降\n\n如果中国人口降到一半\n\n我们会过上好日子吗？", "url": "https://x.com/ming_li90112/status/2117124529063698700"}, {"author_id": "2080217496267923456", "created_at": "2026-11-03T07:06:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117513760311276021"], "id": "2117513760311276021", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "沒有150萬不敢生！最新調查曝育齡世代焦慮　專家籲「台積電模式」助育兒\n\n#育齡世代 #出生人口 #TFC台北生殖中心 https://t.co/CbR6b1VVpD", "url": "https://x.com/knews_taiwan/status/2117513760311276021"}, {"author_id": "1854578338414665745", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117602694567444576"], "id": "2117602694567444576", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 646, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10年时间，由于习近平的独裁统治，造成中国的生存环境极端恶化，\n并导致新出生人口逐年下降，到现在只剩下零头了！ https://t.co/7VvRTiCcgL", "url": "https://x.com/JenniferLi67342/status/2117602694567444576"}, {"author_id": "1839340927166578688", "created_at": "2026-11-03T04:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117466800677929325"], "id": "2117466800677929325", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 545, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国近25年的出生人口曲线图✅✅✅\n\n统计局做表格的这位先生\n绝对是旷世奇才\n\n我TM足足看了5分钟才缓过劲来 https://t.co/Wp5DnMhvCy", "url": "https://x.com/ke_ba57088/status/2117466800677929325"}, {"author_id": "1464536809606631427", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:44:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117236513905991861"], "id": "2117236513905991861", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok根据中国最近20年的出生人口和死亡人口，预测下大概多久中年失业和应届生就业困难的问题能够得到缓解？", "url": "https://x.com/wkussi/status/2117236513905991861"}, {"author_id": "1986426163074637827", "created_at": "2026-11-02T10:02:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117195714958905463"], "id": "2117195714958905463", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年中国出生人口792万，比上年少了162万。2025年前三季度结婚登记同比回升8.5%，有人据此预测2026年会反弹到818万到855万。我觉得会小幅回升，但很难超过850万。@grok 准不准？", "url": "https://x.com/58tzwc/status/2117195714958905463"}, {"author_id": "340142471", "created_at": "2026-11-03T19:01:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117693680547205369"], "id": "2117693680547205369", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 78, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117118005092225167", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "这两张图，建议截图留着当反面教材📊\n\n第一张把纵轴倒过来，出生人口明明一路往下掉，画出来却像在猛涨\n\n第二张把月份倒着排，10月放最左边，涨和跌直接对调\n\n数据一个没改，光动坐标轴就能把跌画成涨，看图先看轴👀 https://t.co/JXPtyrAQZ6 https://t.co/AayowqEPGH", "url": "https://x.com/Betaer/status/2117693680547205369"}, {"author_id": "1925108905266544640", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:37:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117234670513652045"], "id": "2117234670513652045", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 221, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "卧槽！第一次见到连出生人口都能做出“反向增长”的报表！\n\n2016年出生1786万人，2025年只剩792万人，10年直接打了个对折还不止。\n\n股票反着买，别墅靠大海；报表反着做，升官又发财。\n\n我愿称之为第五大发明：连下降都能画出上升感！ https://t.co/VXZamGDskz", "url": "https://x.com/lushi1447172/status/2117234670513652045"}, {"author_id": "2043207917751463936", "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:23:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117321760458866836"], "id": "2117321760458866836", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2026年前9个月，生育津贴已经砸出781亿，全年预计再破千亿。\n2024年生育保险基金支出一度冲到1403亿的历史峰值，2025年还在1350亿以上高位徘徊。\n钱花得越来越多，出生人口却越来越少。\n是补贴力度不够，还是真正卡住的根本不是这点钱？\n#生育津贴 #低生育率", "url": "https://x.com/Maoerai/status/2117321760458866836"}, {"author_id": "1059670824389533696", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:46:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117629415949553856"], "id": "2117629415949553856", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117112437682078189", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "不说别的，我感谢计划生育🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻\n中国要是依然保持每年2000-5000万的出生人口，现在人口规模可以突破16-18亿。单休月薪三千工作都要抢，跟印度一样外卖10分钟送达，你不干外卖有的是人干。\n每年毕业季3000万人失业，不敢想，真的不敢想。\n计划生育，罪在当代，功在后代。 https://t.co/JkCeRRNbpg", "url": "https://x.com/TinaWu83126140/status/2117629415949553856"}, {"author_id": "2109577075548098560", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:23:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117593437134610701"], "id": "2117593437134610701", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一定会走上贬值通胀的道路\n\n目前通缩情形不利于年轻人的发展，年轻人工资收入不如体制内退休人员，怎么会结婚生育，出生人口断崖式下跌，社会方方面面都会出问题，最基本的人口再生产都玩不转了，化什么债…\n\n2012日本无限量QE，日元一路贬值，这条路人民币一定会重新走一遍，别无他法", "url": "https://x.com/w2sbg4Cf/status/2117593437134610701"}, {"author_id": "2027341342188388352", "created_at": "2026-11-02T15:26:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117277242254631019"], "id": "2117277242254631019", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "预告：《工作不需要我的日子----中国90后的十五种人生》第三个人物将是1995年出生的上海幼儿园女教师。她曾经工作顺心，家庭稳定，却因出生人口减少、幼儿园缩减规模而失业，目前背着房贷，老公的工作也不乐观，原本幸福的生活突然变得杂乱而迷茫，欢迎朋友们关注支持。#互关 #真诚交友 #永不取关", "url": "https://x.com/heartEmilybb/status/2117277242254631019"}, {"author_id": "2108176717982613504", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:10:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117258042601545968"], "id": "2117258042601545968", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 429, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "各位，听我一句劝，最近无论遇到什么事，都先别死！\n\n现在出生率已经低到这个地步了，你以为重新投胎还能回到原来的出生地吗？\n\n去年出生人口最多的是印度，2000多万，后面还有非洲那些国家。说实话，这几个选项摆在面前，估计不少人都得犹豫半天。", "url": "https://x.com/Yang112899/status/2117258042601545968"}, {"author_id": "1704460250584346624", "created_at": "2026-11-03T03:36:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117460843671740827"], "id": "2117460843671740827", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 167, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "现在年轻人不愿意生孩子，真的不能全怪年轻人。\n\n2025年全国出生人口792万，比上一年少了162万。\n\n说实话，换谁都得算算账。\n\n房贷要还，工作不稳定，结婚要花钱，生孩子要花钱，奶粉、教育、托育，哪一样不要钱？\n\n更现实的是，很多年轻夫妻连自己都快养不起了，还敢轻易要孩子吗？ https://t.co/JWGspoE7Nr", "url": "https://x.com/lgvpid/status/2117460843671740827"}, {"author_id": "2295669319", "created_at": "2026-11-03T18:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117678193721135180"], "id": "2117678193721135180", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "看着统计局公布的出生人口数据持续回落的老郑，在与晚辈促膝长谈后彻底放下了催生的执念。\n高昂教育成本与职场断层让陈浩和林思佳屡屡退缩，旁人怪青年不肯吃苦，老人却读懂了这份克制；\n当养育代价远超普通工薪的负荷极限，选择推迟或不生不是任性摆烂，而是对生命最深沉的敬畏；", "url": "https://x.com/MybroBot/status/2117678193721135180"}, {"author_id": "1378164402101182469", "created_at": "2026-11-03T09:28:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117549526043255291"], "id": "2117549526043255291", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4585, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "中国三年困难时期饿死了一千多万人？\n\n这个说法本身就是概念混淆。\n\n今天跟大家说清楚这个事情！\n\n权威史料记载，1960 年中国总人口较上年减少一千万，但总人口减少，并不等于非正常死亡的人数。", "url": "https://x.com/Appraiser008/status/2117549526043255291"}, {"author_id": "604525447", "created_at": "2026-11-02T07:50:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117162308560699767"], "id": "2117162308560699767", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "引用的国家统计局数据：2025 年出生人口 792 万人，出生率 5.63‰，比 2024 年少了 162 万人；2016 年还是 1786 万人，十年降了 55.7%。同时死亡 1131 万人，自然增长率 -2.41‰。它把原因归到三块：育龄妇女减少、家庭养育成本高、就业和收入预期不稳，结论是政策要从“鼓励生”转向“降低养育约束”。", "url": "https://x.com/ligen00/status/2117162308560699767"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1992461", "name": "Gabe", "username": "fishjar"}, {"id": "1611656170393194497", "name": "Можно", "username": "AlanWan76319411"}, {"id": "1359061717414629380", "name": "Nina", "username": "Ninalvz"}, {"id": "1951064331187372032", "name": "胖虎的日常", "username": "xianebvjsjj"}, {"id": "2097629682543763456", "name": "8+1受害者", "username": "haozihan001"}, {"id": "2009622249247281152", "name": "带上蟑螂去你家做客", "username": "lanchang_blue"}, {"id": "2061519004125298688", "name": "杨千万", "username": "qianwan_X"}, {"id": "785611716155498500", "name": "SAYA’S DIARY", "username": "SAYAS_DIARY"}, {"id": "1725927523291439104", "name": "脱鞋走路", "username": "ming_li90112"}, {"id": "2080217496267923456", "name": "知新聞", "username": "knews_taiwan"}, {"id": "1854578338414665745", "name": "Jennifer Lin", "username": "JenniferLi67342"}, {"id": "1839340927166578688", "name": "不对劲🏆", "username": "ke_ba57088"}, {"id": "1464536809606631427", "name": "野生树莓", "username": "wkussi"}, {"id": "1986426163074637827", "name": "ddfxs", "username": "58tzwc"}, {"id": "340142471", "name": "Betaer - 蓝V互关 Follow Me, I'll Follow Back💯", "username": "Betaer"}, {"id": "1925108905266544640", "name": "blueberry", "username": "lushi1447172"}, {"id": "2043207917751463936", "name": "猫儿不偷腥 Dr.", "username": "Maoerai"}, {"id": "1059670824389533696", "name": "orz", "username": "TinaWu83126140"}, {"id": "2109577075548098560", "name": "Cf", "username": "w2sbg4Cf"}, {"id": "2027341342188388352", "name": "Emily-NotesOnBeing", "username": "heartEmilybb"}, {"id": "2108176717982613504", "name": "在见已是三楼", "username": "Yang112899"}, {"id": "1704460250584346624", "name": "姬无名", "username": "lgvpid"}, {"id": "2295669319", "name": "Mybro", "username": "MybroBot"}, {"id": "1378164402101182469", "name": "🇨🇳 大牛🇨🇳", "username": "Appraiser008"}, {"id": "604525447", "name": "Jimmy Lee", "username": "ligen00"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2117693680547205369", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyi53vdvf7qieixa60m97wnonlp", "oldest_id": "2117078825205121535", "result_count": 25}}
